# Oxide's own QML module: what Quickshell.Hyprland is for Hyprland. `import Oxide` in any Quickshell config.
#   OxideState  live compositor state (workspaces, windows, focus, outputs, profile) and dispatch()
#   Sys         system numbers (cpu, memory, battery, network ...)
module Oxide
singleton OxideState OxideState.qml
singleton Sys Sys.qml
